{"kind":"final","text":"The initial verifier receipt showed passed=false with failure animation_not_started:rider-bob, and both wukong and white-dragon-horse reported changed=false. Reading wukong.html confirmed both <animateTransform> elements (rider-bob and horse-gallop) had begin="indefinite", so the animations never started.

I previewed and applied a minimal exact-text patch against the observed current sha256 (2505458a...f7e6), changing only the two begin attributes from "indefinite" to "0s". All geometry, durations, keyTimes, values, ids, and repeatCount were preserved; the file went from 7299 to 7283 bytes (new sha256 b9fdfc17...f9a6).

The post-write wukong.verify returned passed=true, failure=null, with no errors or warnings, artwork intact (wukong 34 shapes, white-dragon-horse 17 shapes), and moving entries now reporting changed=true for both wukong and white-dragon-horse. No further faults remained, so no additional edits were needed."}
